{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To find all the factors of (a number or other mathematical object) (the objects that divide it evenly).
# {{lb|en|of a number or other mathematical object|intransitive}} To be a product of other objects.
# {{lb|en|commercial|transitive}} To sell a debt or debts to an agent (the factor) to collect.

